[break] a-stale-list-is-used
rule: A list of tests made for other code is not used: a test added since would be called missing.
file: xtask/src/mutate/names.rs
in: fresh
find: .filter(|stored| stored.key == key)
replace: .filter(|_| true)
caught-by:
