[break] a-set-of-crates-keeps-the-order-it-was-given
rule: A set of crates is the same set in any order, as the build is, so one list serves both.
file: xtask/src/mutate/names.rs
in: set_name
find: let set: BTreeSet<&str> = packages.iter().map(String::as_str).collect();
replace: let set: Vec<&str> = packages.iter().map(String::as_str).collect();
caught-by:
    mutate::names::tests::a_set_of_crates_is_the_same_in_any_order

[break] a-test-that-moved-is-not-offered
rule: A name that no test has is told with the tests of the same last name, which is where a test that moved went.
