in: refresh
find: copied: now
replace: copied: 0
caught-by:
    last_good::tests::a_good_run_keeps_its_binary_and_the_same_build_is_not_copied_twice

[break] a-half-written-file-is-left-beside-the-copy
rule: Nothing but the copy and its stamp is left in its folder.
