in: refresh
find: forget_moved_aside(&dir);
replace:
caught-by:
    last_good::tests::a_good_run_keeps_its_binary_and_the_same_build_is_not_copied_twice

[break] the-copy-offers-another-command
rule: The copy offers `replace` and `links`, and no other command.
file: xtask/src/last_good.rs
find: pub(crate) const OFFERED: [&str; 2] = ["replace", "links"];
replace: pub(crate) const OFFERED: [&str; 2] = ["replace", "check"];
caught-by:
    last_good::tests::the_copy_offers_replace_and_links_and_nothing_else

[break] the-copy-is-not-known-by-its-folder
rule: A binary in the copy's folder is the copy, and any other is a fresh build.
file: xtask/src/last_good.rs
in: is_the_copy
find: folder == FOLDER
replace: folder != FOLDER
caught-by:
    last_good::tests::the_copy_is_known_by_its_folder

[break] a-newer-file-is-not-seen
rule: The copy names the files of xtask/ changed since it was built.
